stranger things fans suspected from the  start that l's number 11 tattoo meant  she was just one of several test  subjects experimented upon at hawkins  lab  and season two confirmed that with the  appearance of carly aka number eight  yupikai movie lovers it's jan here and  today i want to delve deep into some  hidden clues you may have missed in  season 2 which reveals secrets about  more young people likely abducted by  hawkins lab for experimentation  and who may appear in season 3 and  beyond obviously i'll be discussing  spoilers from both  seasons so take care if you're not up to  date  carly and elle's tattoo suggests that  there are at least nine other test  subjects in project mk  ultra and given that the lost sisters  who spent time together in the lab's  rainbow room  have different powers to each other with  carly being able to cast illusions  we can assume the other young people  subjected to the lab's experiments may  also have developed  different abilities although carly  herself doesn't mention any other  hawkins test subjects  eleven learned about her lost sister  when she read her mother's mind  and investigated further with the files  her aunt becky gave her  and it's in those files that we get some  glimpses of news reports about  abductions and missing children and  mothers  carly's file was among those papers so  it's very likely that eleven's mother  thought those reports were connected to  project mk  ultra and the hawkins lab the first  file that 11 flips past is a news  clipping about a cleveland girl who's  gone missing in indiana  the report states that a 16 year old  junior high school honours student and  girls basketball team captain from ohio  went missing at some point after leaving  an indiana junior high gym  to go back to her bus that was returning  home there's no date on this clipping  but it's eerie that this potentially has  a connection to the ending of season 2  where we see the shadow monster in the  upside down looming over the hawkins  middle school gym  the news report also states that the  girl's father is a widower so she has a  missing mother  and her father describes her as a genius  and exceptionally strong for her age  this could mean her mother was  experimented on at hawkins or elsewhere  and after leaving the mk ultra project  gave birth to a girl with special gifts  the mother could have later died from  the effects of the experiments but the  hawkins lab learned about the gifted  girl and abducted her while she was  visiting indiana  there's also another intriguing  possibility though which is that the  girl was actually playing basketball at  hawkins middle school itself  where we know there's a portal that both  the demogorgon and 11 use to cross  between the upside down and the real  world  well if this girl was gifted like 11 she  might have stumbled across the portal  and traveled to the upside down either  willingly or accidentally  where perhaps she got lost or maybe she  even created that portal in hawkins  middle school in the first place  okay so if that's not crazy enough yet  there's more in the clipping the news  report continues mentioning that a girl  matching the missing girl's general  description was later discovered  wandering around  an indiana suburb there are various  possibilities here  one is that this girl was abducted by  the hawkins lab but she escaped and they  managed to find her and take her back to  the facility before she got to safety  another possibility is that the hawkins  lab guys arranged for a similar looking  girl to be seen in the neighborhood as a  way of trying to hide the fact that the  real girl had gone missing  or they could simply have had carly use  her powers to cast an illusion  making it look like the girl was still  out there remember they've done these  kind of things before  for example releasing a fake dead body  for will to cover up the fact that he'd  gone missing in the upside down  alternatively another pretty far-fetched  possibility which may have sped through  your mind if you're a fan of the flash  tv show  is that the upside down is a replica of  our world just that it's been corrupted  by the shadow monster  after all we see the same buildings from  hawkins in the upside down so could  there have been doppelganger versions of  people somewhere in the alternate  dimension  and a doppelganger of the missing girl  was sent to our world from the upside  down  okay back to the other reports behind  the cleveland clipping is another one  that only has some very sparse details  the title appears to read another girl  lost and you can see the words go police  mentioned in the tiny bit of the report  which is showing  perhaps suggesting that the chicago  police were mentioned if that's the case  then this looks like a chicago girl  who's disappeared too  another file which 11 flicks past  mentions a baby boy abducted from a  memphis hospital  the circumstances reported around the  abduction are particularly suspect as  the account states that the boy went  missing with a nurse who turned up for  work unexpectedly after being off sick  for a week  the article then states that the nurse  was discovered dead from a gunshot wound  at her house but the boy was missing  it sounds like the nurse was probably  used by the hawkins lab or the mk ultra  project  to abduct the boy and then she was  killed to avoid her squealing  the fact she was off sick and then  suddenly appeared at work may suggest  she spent time either willingly or under  coercion at the hawkins lab or another  secret government facility  it seems like the mk ultra project were  looking for the child's mother because  she was probably an ex-test subject and  they needed the nurse to find out when  or where she was going to give birth  the fact that the show has gone to the  effort of putting so much information  and a photo in this clipping  makes me think this is another gifted  character which the show runners could  be setting up to appear in a future  season  there's also something intriguing in  another newspaper clipping just behind  the baby boy article  if you look carefully there's some text  about someone missing from san diego  san diego is of course in california and  we know that two new main characters max  and billy moved from california to  hawkins in season two  though we don't know where from exactly  we do know that billy has a lot of  issues though some of which may be  explained by his authoritarian bullying  father but we don't know anything about  billy's mother and why his father is no  longer with her in some ways the  introduction of billy in season two was  a bit sketchy and perplexing as he was a  real jerk  pretty much the whole time so i do  wonder whether the showrunners decided  to include him more for potential future  storylines  and in fact the duffer brothers have  said that they wanted to have a human  villain in the show that could disrupt  the lives of their characters  so it's a long shot but i wonder if  there's any potential connection between  billy's mother  and this possible missing child or  person in san diego  there's also one more set of clippings  which are a bit more cryptic  one says a mother and daughter from  pawtucket have gone missing  there's also a picture of a young boy  which mentions a county hospital  and another article seems to talk about  a wave of disappearances of children and  teens  at the bottom of the piece there's  mention of the gary police department  and gary is a small city in indiana not  far from chicago  now i don't expect we'll see all of  these reported abductions or missing  children in future seasons some of the  children or adults may be dead  long gone or not important for the  overall storyline the duffer brothers  want to tell in the show  some may also just be random reports  that are unconnected to the hawkins lab  however i do think that the missing baby  boy and the missing girls basketball  captain are very specific and detailed  reports as i think we'll see feed into  either season three or four  by the way if you cast your mind back to  season one you'll remember that when  hopper was reading newspaper articles  about dr brenner one of them mentions  six subjects coming forward to give  testimony about the project mk ultra  experiments  and alongside that there was a picture  of young women dressed in the kind of  hospital gown we see elwha when she  first escapes in the lab  so just as terry ives who took part in  the mk ultra project gave birth to a  gifted daughter in the form of 11  any of those women in that photograph  could also be the mothers of similarly  gifted children who will appear in the  show going forward  on top of that given carly's awesome  power to make people see whatever she  wants them to  there's a possibility that hopper's  flashbacks to his last days with his  daughter  are merely memories of illusions the  hawkins lab made him  see and that really his daughter sarah  was also one of the children abducted  and experimented on  something else i think is interesting is  the strong x-men vibe to the show which  has been clear since the very first  episode eleven already has powers  reminiscent of various x-men like  professor x magneto and jean grey  and i wonder whether the duffer brothers  are considering potentially teaming  l up with multiple gifted individuals  like carly and others out there who have  yet to meet  i love how the seasons have developed so  far but if the shadow monster is going  to be an ongoing big bad  at some point i imagine it will take  more than just what 11 can currently do  to defeat it  it's possible that 11 could continue to  power up as she has done this season but  it wouldn't surprise me if eventually  the monster's defeat  ended up being a group effort so what do  you think about having more gifted  children or individuals showing up in  future seasons of stranger things  and do you have any theories or  predictions on who they'll be  and what powers they'll have let me know  what you think in the comments below and  don't forget to also subscribe to my  channel for a chance to win an awesome  stranger things funko pop  i'm currently working on more stranger  things plus thor ragnarok videos  so hit the notification bell to get my  new videos as soon as they're live  and in the meantime you can check out  more videos you might like here  thanks for watching and see you next  time yupikai movie lovers  you

